# Tanaris & Dustwallow Marsh (47-48): the last Gadgetzan and Steamwheedle Port quests, the Brood of
# Onyxia and Razzeric's booster, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/tanaris_dustwallow_marsh_47_48.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Tanaris, area 440, and
# Dustwallow Marsh, area 15, and the quest pages). The quest list is section 11 of
# addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
#
# Carried in: Zanzil's Mixture and a Fool's Stout (1119, Booty Bay, a two-hour timer: the first
# stop), The Sunken Temple (3380, Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas), Shipping and Handling (95296,
# Friz Frazzlespark in Riverglades), Screecher Spirits (3520, Yeh'kinya; its screechers are in
# Feralas) and The Super Egg-O-Matic (2741, Gadgetzan; its Hippogryph Egg is in Feralas).
# Left out: the Zul'Farrak dungeon quests (Scarab Shells, Troll Temper, Divino-matic Rod, The
# Prophecy of Mosh'aru, Tiara of the Deep), The Stone Watcher and Return to Thunder Bluff (they
# follow The Platinum Discs from the Uldaman dungeon). The four egg quests of Curgle Cranklehop
# (one random egg from the Egg Crate, repeatable) are a note.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar and a flight to Freewind Post; the Shimmering Flats (Kravel, Razzeric);
# Gadgetzan; a loop east (Steamwheedle Port, Lost Rigger Cove, the Wastewander camps); Dustwallow
# Marsh (the Seaforium Booster, the eggs of Onyxia) and the hearthstone back; the Shimmering Flats
# and Gadgetzan for the booster; a long loop south-west (Broken Pillar, the Noxious Lair, the
# Dunemaul Compound, Thistleshrub Valley) ending with Tooga's walk home to Steamwheedle Port; the
# Gaping Chasm and OOX-17/TN; Gadgetzan; the Shimmering Flats; Orgrimmar; Booty Bay and Riverglades
# on the way to the Hinterlands.

guide Tanaris & Dustwallow Marsh (47-48)
faction horde
levels 47 48
carry 580 1119 1429 2741 3123 3380 3520 95296
leave 580 650 864 1122 1429 2641 2874 3123 3444
next The Hinterlands (48-49)
# Follow-ups for later guides: Report Back to Fizzlebub and Deliver to MacKinley (14), The Stone
# Circle (13), Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient, Return to Apothecary Zinge and Ripple Recovery (12).

# Orgrimmar ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
fly "Freewind Post, Thousand Needles" npc 3310
tip Coming from the Eastern Kingdoms: take the zeppelin from Grom'gol to Orgrimmar first. Doras, the wind rider master, stands on the tower by the Valley of Strength.

# The Shimmering Flats -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Thousand Needles
goto "Ride east from Freewind Post down to the Mirage Raceway on the Shimmering Flats" at 78.6,76.8 r 40
turnin 1119
tip Kravel first: the Fool's Stout from Booty Bay has a two-hour timer.
accept 1120
turnin 1120
tip Give the stout to the Gnome Pit Boss next to Kravel and let the gnomes drink it.
accept 1122
tip Report Back to Fizzlebub is handed in at Booty Bay by a later guide: keep it.
accept 1187
tip Razzeric's Seaforium Booster waits in a crate in Dustwallow Marsh; this guide goes there soon.

