accept 82
accept 2781 at 51.8,27.0
accept 2875 at 51.8,27.0
tip The two WANTED notes hang on the poster by the north gate.
turnin 2741
note "Open the Egg Crate and hand the egg inside to Curgle Cranklehop, next to the Egg-O-Matic (only if you brought a Hippogryph Egg from Feralas)" npc 7763
accept 5863
accept 1691
accept 864
tip Return to Apothecary Zinge goes to Undercity with the next guide: keep the Sealed Field Testing Kit.
accept 2605
bind 7733
tip Any mob in Tanaris can drop an OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, about one in a hundred: keep it if one drops, this guide uses it later.

