tip The Centipaar insects fill the Noxious Lair, the hive west of Broken Pillar.
do 97530 bg
do 5863
tip Gor'marok the Ravager waits in the small cave at the back of the compound.
do 97530
tip Any Dunemaul ogre can drop the bangle, but it is rare: keep killing them.
do 3161 at 45.5,65.8
tip The richest ornament fields are south of the compound and further south-west.
do 2605 bg
do 3362
do 2605
